      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Eligibility call",
          "heading": "Steve Hansen says Mark Nawaqanitawase would be better off playing for Fiji",
          "body": "Nawaqanitawase, 26, is still weighing his Test options after returning to 15s following two years in rugby league with the Sydney Roosters. He has signed with Japan's Saitama Wild Knights and is eligible for Italy and Fiji as well as Australia, for whom he has 11 caps. On the Rugby Unity podcast, Hansen said that if the wing prioritises Japan, he \"would be better off playing for Fiji.\" Hansen also said Nawaqanitawase needs to decide reasonably quickly."
        },
