        {
          "kicker": "Squad leadership",
          "heading": "Lee Blackett names George Ford and Fin Smith as England's squad leaders",
          "body": "England attack coach Lee Blackett has named George Ford and Fin Smith among the squad's leaders as camp gets under way for Australia. The newcomers come from nine different clubs and run different shapes and lines, so the coaches want everyone \"on the same page\". Ford, Blackett says, is \"a dream to work with as a 10\", while Henry Slade has settled back in comfortably. The Australia test is just over a week away."
        },
