      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Galthié loses injured Brau-Boirie, Hastoy and Gazzotti, calls up Jelonch and Depoortere",
          "body": "Fabien Galthié has been forced into late changes to his extended squad after Brau-Boirie, Hastoy and Gazzotti all picked up injuries in Top 14 action and will miss the resumption of the competition. Planet Rugby also lists Karl Sorin among the withdrawals. Nicolas Depoortere, Anthony Jelonch and the uncapped Louis Le Brun are called in, with Thomas Laclayat also added. The November block now runs against Fiji, the Springboks and Argentina, with Jalibert, Ramos and Marchand already absent."
        },
