    "388": {
      "date": "2026-10-30",
      "edition": "Friday 30 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad news",
          "heading": "Gus McCarthy to captain Ireland XV against Fiji A, Edogbo brothers included",
          "body": "Ireland XV head coach Mark Sexton has named a 28-man squad for next month's game against Fiji A in Cork, with Leinster hooker Gus McCarthy captaining the side. Sexton's squad includes Edwin and Seán Edogbo, both Munster forwards, and Kieran Brookes, who last wore an Ireland jersey as a teenager before going on to play Test rugby for England. Sexton called it \"a meaningful fixture against what is a talented Fiji side.\""
        },
