      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad update",
          "heading": "Duhan van der Merwe released from Scotland squad to play for Edinburgh",
          "body": "Duhan van der Merwe has been released from Scotland's squad to return to Edinburgh for their United Rugby Championship match against Benetton, with Gregor Townsend wanting the winger to build match fitness. It is not a punishment, and he remains part of the 37-man squad for November. He has played just 18 minutes this season, a comeback against the Lions cut short by a dislocated finger. Townsend said: \"It was a much better outcome than it looked at the time.\""
        },
