          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Thomas Gallo sidelined for at least six months after wrist surgery in Lyon",
          "body": "Thomas Gallo, Argentina's prop, will be sidelined for at least six months after dislocating his left wrist in Lyon's 31-27 win at Bayonne, with an operation on Saturday. Rodrigo Martínez of the Dragons has replaced him in Felipe Contepomi's 33-man squad, which began a three-day mini-camp in London on Monday ahead of the Ireland opener. The loss removes a loosehead option at the start of a three-test European tour."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
