          "kicker": "Awards night",
          "heading": "Fraser McReight wins maiden John Eales Medal as Rob Valetini misses out",
          "body": "Fraser McReight has claimed his maiden John Eales Medal at the Rugby Australia Awards in Sydney, beating Jeremy Williams and Rob Valetini, who was denied a third-straight medal. He also won Defender of the Year for Wallabies vs France in Brisbane earlier in the night. The Reds superstar joins the likes of Michael Hooper, David Pocock and George Smith among legendary opensides to claim the award."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
