          "kicker": "Squad news",
          "heading": "Japan Rugby names a 35-player roster for their Nations Series campaign",
          "body": "Japan have named a 35-player roster for the Nations Series, and today's coverage gives the squad size but not the individual names. Their next fixture is Wales in Round 4, and they sit 10 of 12 on the log after going down 28-34 to Fiji. Their record reads one win from three, with the points for and against running at 62 and 88. The selections themselves will have to wait for a fuller list."
        },
